  message: "Shipped via PR #3618 (commit a4f06ed418). Added one sentence to v4.1.0 CHANGELOG entry covering the Pattern.matches() framework_role meta fallback (framework_patterns.py:396-401 + 423-428) — the backward-compat shim that lets unmigrated YAML rules (phoenix.yaml, falcon.yaml, yesod.yaml, library-exports.yaml, etc.) continue to match post-fold symbols. Forward-references WI-fojun-vokat as the planned shim removal. The other content WI-kinib-fopil originally asked for (per-PR commit SHAs for Wave 5, aggregate values folded, audit-findings 0013/0014 pointers, family detail) was already covered by the existing v4.1.0 entry — no duplication needed. WI-nitil-sobos was concurrently closed out (already-shipped at commits 9071f774 + 6d6fc8df, just stale in the tracker)."  # 074e
